<span id="A6.T9.2.26.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><del id="A6.T9.2.26.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_del updiagonalstrike ltx_font_bold"><span id="A6.T9.2.26.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text">Retrieved Doc3</span></del><span id="A6.T9.2.26.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">: </span> …</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T9.2.27" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A6.T9.2.27.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_b">
<span id="A6.T9.2.27.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:455.2pt;">
<span id="A6.T9.2.27.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.T9.2.27.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Final Answer: </span> <span id="A6.T9.2.27.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">International Federation of Association Football</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 9: </span>Comparison between HANRAG and Adaptive-RAG for Complex Query</figcaption>
</figure>
