<span id="A7.T11.2.15.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Query: Which company acquired Intime Department Store?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T11.2.16" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T11.2.16.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A7.T11.2.16.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:455.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T11.2.16.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Answer: single-step question</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T11.2.17" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T11.2.17.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A7.T11.2.17.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:455.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T11.2.17.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Example-3:</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T11.2.18" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T11.2.18.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A7.T11.2.18.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:455.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T11.2.18.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Query: What honors did Yao Ming win in the NBA?
When did he retire from the NBA?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T11.2.19" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T11.2.19.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A7.T11.2.19.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:455.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T11.2.19.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Answer: compound question</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T11.2.20" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T11.2.20.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A7.T11.2.20.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:455.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T11.2.20.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Example-4:</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T11.2.21" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T11.2.21.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A7.T11.2.21.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:455.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T11.2.21.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Query: What city is the person who broadened the doctrine of philosophy of language from?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T11.2.22" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T11.2.22.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A7.T11.2.22.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:455.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T11.2.22.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Answer: complex question</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T11.2.23" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T11.2.23.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A7.T11.2.23.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:455.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T11.2.23.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Example-5:</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T11.2.24" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T11.2.24.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A7.T11.2.24.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:455.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T11.2.24.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Query: What is the scientific classification of conch shells, and what are the common uses of conch shells in various cultures?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T11.2.25" class="ltx_tr">
