<span id="A7.T13.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">You must follow these rules:</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T13.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T13.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A7.T13.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:455.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T13.2.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Rule 1: If the doc is related to question, you must output true; if not, output false.</span>
