<span id="A7.T16.2.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Now let me give you some examples for your reference:</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T16.2.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T16.2.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A7.T16.2.7.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:455.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T16.2.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Example1:</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T16.2.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T16.2.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A7.T16.2.8.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:455.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T16.2.8.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Simple Question1: “‘When was Arthur’s Magazine first published? “‘</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T16.2.9" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T16.2.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A7.T16.2.9.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:455.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T16.2.9.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Simple Question2: “‘What is the main focus of Arthur’s Magazine content? “‘</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T16.2.10" class="ltx_tr">
