</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T16.2.12" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T16.2.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A7.T16.2.12.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:455.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T16.2.12.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Simple Question1: “‘What frequency does KMBZ-FM broadcast on? “‘</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T16.2.13" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T16.2.13.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A7.T16.2.13.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:455.2pt;">
<span id="A7.T16.2.13.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Simple Question2: “‘What music did KMBZ-FM play in 1975? “‘</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T16.2.14" class="ltx_tr">
